{
  "_comment": "Phase 167.1.1.1 plan 02 (D-15, D-16, D-18). Shared oracle for the matcher's AUM basis. Both runners read this whole file: vitest (src/lib/holding-equity-contribution.parity.test.ts) replays it against holdingEquityContribution AND holdingEquityContributionLocal; pytest (analytics-service/tests/test_holding_equity_contribution.py) replays it against holding_equity_contribution. Every figure is hand-typed; nothing is derived from the code under test. expected_ts is what BOTH TypeScript functions return; expected_py is what the Python helper returns. They differ ONLY on the D-18 case (a derivative whose unrealized_pnl_usd is null: TypeScript counts 0, Python returns null so the caller withholds it as pnl_missing). JSON cannot carry NaN or Infinity, so a field holding one is written {\"nonfinite\": \"NaN\" | \"Infinity\" | \"-Infinity\"} and decoded identically by both runners.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "derivative_counts_pnl_not_notional",
      "holding_type": "derivative",
      "value_usd": 5000000,
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": 500,
      "expected_ts": 500,
      "expected_py": 500
    },
    {
      "name": "spot_counts_value",
      "holding_type": "spot",
      "value_usd": 1234.5,
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": 99,
      "expected_ts": 1234.5,
      "expected_py": 1234.5
    },
    {
      "name": "spot_null_value",
      "holding_type": "spot",
      "value_usd": null,
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": null,
      "expected_ts": 0,
      "expected_py": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "spot_nan_value",
      "holding_type": "spot",
      "value_usd": {
        "nonfinite": "NaN"
      },
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": null,
      "expected_ts": 0,
      "expected_py": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "spot_bool_value",
      "holding_type": "spot",
      "value_usd": true,
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": null,
      "expected_ts": 0,
      "expected_py": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "spot_string_value",
      "holding_type": "spot",
      "value_usd": "5",
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": null,
      "expected_ts": 0,
      "expected_py": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "losing_short_kept_signed",
      "holding_type": "derivative",
      "value_usd": 3000000,
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": -1200,
      "expected_ts": -1200,
      "expected_py": -1200
    },
    {
      "name": "derivative_zero_pnl",
      "holding_type": "derivative",
      "value_usd": 800000,
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": 0,
      "expected_ts": 0,
      "expected_py": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "derivative_null_pnl_is_withheld",
      "holding_type": "derivative",
      "value_usd": 5000000,
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": null,
      "expected_ts": 0,
      "expected_py": null
    },
    {
      "name": "derivative_infinite_pnl",
      "holding_type": "derivative",
      "value_usd": 250000,
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": {
        "nonfinite": "Infinity"
      },
      "expected_ts": 0,
      "expected_py": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "derivative_nan_pnl",
      "holding_type": "derivative",
      "value_usd": 250000,
      "unrealized_pnl_usd": {
        "nonfinite": "NaN"
      },
      "expected_ts": 0,
      "expected_py": 0
    },
    {
